    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Understanding API Documentation\r\n\r\nSkim the documentation for the Open Weather app [here](https://drive.google.com/file/d/14YM40Rev-of7TaPwllaDE7-QvJMI-AgM/view?usp=drive_link). \r\n\r\nUpload the PDF of the API documentation to AI Chat from the library. Then use AI to answer the questions in your activity guide.\r\n\r\n:::details [Not sure what to ask?]\r\nTry one of the following prompts:\r\n- What data does this API provide?\r\n- What parameters do I need to set to get weather for a specific city?\r\n- What units is \"temp\" in?\r\n:::",
